From 366043c764366c62b786df7e8de904b47b3dddab Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Mili Contributors <mili-contributors@example.invalid>
Date: Sat, 28 Nov 2026 11:18:32 +0800
Subject: [PATCH] Carry inventory block entities through owned piston moves

Port from Lophine 7a51f49, Minecraft patch 0131. See META-INF/licenses/carpet-26.3.txt.

Transfer closed chests, trapped chests and barrels under one region owner. Resolve both applicable halves of paired containers; install both before physics can observe the destination. Store inventory metadata in carriedTileEntityCM regardless of whether new moves remain enabled. No command blocks or unaudited block-entity types are admitted.

